<title>PORTUGAL: Allianz raises stake in BPI to 8.9 pct from 5 pct.</title>
<headline>Allianz raises stake in BPI to 8.9 pct from 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allianz Group, via its subsidiary RAS International N.V., raised its stake in Portuguese bank Banco Portugues de Investimento-SGPS to 8.9 percent from 5.0 percent, BPI said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Today 1,318,669 BPI shares traded on Lisbon bourse and closed up 43 escudos to 1,929.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
